  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00d0a eode Satanas on Iudam, se w\u00e6s o\u00f0re naman Scarioth, an of \u00feam twelfum. \u00dea ferde he & sp\u00e6c mid \u00feara sacerda ealdormannum & dugu\u00f0e ealdrum hu he hine him gesealde. And hig fagenydun & him weddedon feoh to syllenne, & he behet & he sohte hu he ea\u00f0elicust hine \u00d0a com se d\u00e6g Azimorum on \u00feam hi woldon hyra Eastron gewyrcan. & he sende Petrum, & Iohannem & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, fara\u00f0 & gearwia\u00f0 us \u00fe\u00e6t we ure Eastron gewyrcon. \u00d0a cw\u00e6don hig, hwar wylt tu \u00fe\u00e6t we gearwion? & he cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him, Nu \u00fe\u00e6nne ge on \u00fea ceastre ga\u00f0 eow agen yrn\u00f0 an man mid w\u00e6terbuce; Filigea\u00f0 And he eow bet\u00e6c\u00f0 mycele healle ged\u00e6fte; gegearwia\u00f0 \u00feara. \u00d0a ferdun hig & gemettun swa he him s\u00e6de, & hig gegearwudun Eastrun. And \u00fea tima w\u00e6s he s\u00e6t & his twelfe apostolas mid him, & he s\u00e6de him, Of gewilnunge ic Ic eow secge \u00fe\u00e6t ic heononfor\u00f0 ne ete, \u00e6r hyt sy on Godes rice gefylled. And onfeng calice & \u00feancas dyde & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Onfo\u00f0 & d\u00e6la\u00f0 betwux eow. So\u00f0lice ic eow secge \u00fe\u00e6t ic ne drince of \u00feises wingeardes cynne \u00e6r Godes rice cume. And he onfengc hlafe & \u00feancude & him sealde, & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00f0is is min lichama, se is for eow geseald; And swa eac \u00fe\u00e6ne calic, sy\u00f0\u00f0an he geeten h\u00e6fde & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00f0es calic",
